---
import Document from '../layouts/Document.astro';
import { localUrl } from '../data/site';
---
<Document title="Notes from the forge" description="Selected changes verified against the project’s release notes. Package readiness does not confirm public store availability." eyebrow="CHANGELOG">
  <section class="release-item"><h2>Hosted Roblox account connection</h2><p class="release-meta">UNRELEASED / NOT LIVE</p><p>The project prepares browser authorization, private saved connections, automatic checks, personal-account image upload, and a separate encrypted account service.</p><p>The service is not deployed. Real consent, upload testing, and Roblox review remain outstanding. <a href={localUrl('account/')}>Current account-linking status.</a></p></section>
  <section class="release-item"><h2>Mask-order diagnostics & repair</h2><p class="release-meta">0.1.7 / ALPHA PACKAGE</p><ul><li>Empty-mask warnings explain the correct Figma layer order and keeping a clipping mask stationary.</li><li>Fix mask order repairs an unambiguous single-frame, single-mask group while preserving settings and supporting Undo.</li><li>Rendered text image fingerprints account for alignment changes across the full text box.</li></ul><p>The project records a live repaired Studio mask test with one runtime script. It does not record a new complete import or real upload for this release.</p></section>
  <section class="release-item"><h2>Fresh mappings for changed artwork</h2><p class="release-meta">0.1.6 / ALPHA PACKAGE</p><p>Rendered text, cropped and filtered fills, and rasterized masks receive image-content fingerprints. Changed images require a fresh asset mapping; unchanged graphics keep their mapping.</p></section>
  <section class="release-item"><h2>Effects & selected-design previews</h2><p class="release-meta">0.1.5 / ALPHA PACKAGE</p><p>The grouped effects picker includes 53 presets. Previews follow configured triggers, timing, easing, and motion. A read-only selected-layer image can be refreshed for preview without adding it to Roblox export assets.</p></section>
  <section class="release-item"><h2>Explicit hover triggers</h2><p class="release-meta">0.1.4 / ALPHA PACKAGE</p><p>Hover Move and Hover Tilt preserve authored transforms and reset on leave, hide, disable, or cleanup. Loop is an explicit trigger. Behavior imports retain one bundled runtime.</p><p>For the complete technical record, consult <code>docs/release-notes.md</code> in the source repository.</p></section>
</Document>
